    <string name="water_help_title">About the water reminder</string>
    <string name="water_help_line1">• Track the amount of water you drink daily.</string>
    <string name="water_help_line2">• In Settings you can change your daily goal, the glass size and other quick amounts.</string>
    <string name="water_help_line3">• If you turn on reminders, the app will notify you at the chosen interval.</string>
    <string name="water_help_line4">• All data is stored locally and never shared outside your device.</string>
    <string name="water_help_line5">• You can add the widget to your home screen to see your daily progress and quickly add/remove water without opening the app.</string>
    <string name="water_help_line6">💧 Tip: An adult should drink between 1.5 and 3 liters of pure water per day. The suggested goal is 2 liters, but you can adjust it based on your needs, activity level, and climate.</string>

