    <string name="water_statistics_help_title">About the statistics</string>
    <string name="water_statistics_help_line1">• The chart shows the last 7 days, including days with no records. Colored bars and a check mean you reached your goal; gray bars mean you did not.</string>
    <string name="water_statistics_help_line2">• The streak counts consecutive days with the goal reached. Today does not break it while the day is still going.</string>
    <string name="water_statistics_help_line3">• The daily average uses the last 7 full days: it leaves out today and the days before your first record.</string>
    <string name="water_statistics_help_line4">• Whether a day met the goal is based on your current goal, including past days. All data stays on your device.</string>
    <string name="water_statistics_help_line5">• Tap any day in the history to correct the recorded amount.</string>

